<title>FRANCE: EU raises daily durum wheat semolina refund.</title>
<headline>EU raises daily durum wheat semolina refund.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday raised the refund on daily exports of durum wheat semolina to 10 Ecus per tonne from nine, France's grain office ONIC said.</p>
<p>The EU also raised the refund on daily exports of rye flour to 41 Ecus per tonne from 30, it said.</p>
<p>It also set the refund on daily exports of malt made from wheat at 10 Ecus per tonne.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
